  "note": [
    "House terminology for machine translation and for auditing existing message/blog files.",
    "Each target term is the wording already dominant in messages/<locale>.json — the counts",
    "behind the choices were taken from the shipped copy, not invented. `avoid` lists variants",
    "that exist in the codebase but lose to the house term, so `check` can flag them.",
    "Seeded from the sister project uniglo-diamonds-web (diamond terminology carries over",
    "directly) and extended with Aurelia's jewellery-construction vocabulary: bezel, pavé,",
    "huggie, station necklace and hallmark. 'tennis bracelet' was already seeded from uniglo",
    "(es: 'pulsera de tenis') so it was not duplicated with a second, conflicting Spanish",
    "rendering — see the task-11 report for this call.",
    "To research a new entry: node scripts/i18n/translate.mjs terms \"<english term>\""
